  "text": "Home\nPvM Encyclopedia (PvME) is a Discord server with the largest collection of RS3 (and some OSRS) PvM guides.\n\n\ndiscordInvite.init({\n  inviteCode: 'pvme',\n  title: 'PVME',\n  });\n  discordInvite.render();\n\n\n\nThis website has all the same guides and is updated daily.\nMotivation\n\nMake the PvME guides available outside of Discord.\nImprove guide navigation through a powerful search and an always-visible table of contents.\nFast and lightweight thanks to Mkdocs material.\n\n\n\nLast updated: Nov 15, 2026\n\n      \n    ",
